# The package signing trust root of Arch Linux ARM (aarch64, armv7h).
#
# Arch Linux ARM signs with a key that archlinux-keyring does not have. This pin
# gives the keyring package, its sha256 and its trusted keys, so SigLevel =
# Required stays on. bootstrap/any/usr/local/bin/install-port-keyring reads
# each .pin here and uses the one whose arch list has the Architecture of the
# build. To add a port, add a pin here. Do not change that script.
#
# Fields:
#   keyring   the pacman keyring name, for pacman-key --populate
#   arch      the pacman Architecture values of this pin, separated by spaces
#   mirror    a directory that serves the package. There can be more than one
#             mirror line: install-port-keyring tries them in file order.
#   package   the pinned package, with its version in the name. ⛔ The package
#             is in this directory under that name, because a port deletes an
#             old keyring package from its mirrors.
#   sha256    of that package
#   trusted   one line for each fingerprint in the -trusted file of the
#             keyring, with the expiry of the primary key: YYYY-MM-DD or never
#
# ⛔ The trusted lines are a set, and the build checks the whole set. A
# fingerprint added, removed or with a changed expiry stops the build.
#
# To read the values again, on a host with bsdtar and gpg:
#   curl -sSfL --connect-timeout 15 --max-time 120 -o k.pkg.tar.xz <mirror>/<package>
#   sha256sum k.pkg.tar.xz
#   bsdtar -xOf k.pkg.tar.xz usr/share/pacman/keyrings/archlinuxarm-trusted
#   bsdtar -xOf k.pkg.tar.xz usr/share/pacman/keyrings/archlinuxarm.gpg | \
#     gpg --with-colons --show-keys
#
# Adopted 2026-08-26. Verified on that date against a mirror line below.

keyring = archlinuxarm
arch    = aarch64 armv7h
mirror  = https://ghcr.mirror.archlinux.pkgforge.dev/aarch64/core
mirror  = http://mirror.archlinuxarm.org/aarch64/core
package = archlinuxarm-keyring-20240419-2-any.pkg.tar.xz
sha256  = 3cb36869edfe413672a6e932cc55d7f8386e1a9d3b38663cfb3bc6fe0d146e21
trusted = 68B3537F39A313B3E574D06777193F152BDBE6A6 never
